  "notes_for_review": [
    "Generic 'vegetable oil' and 'oil' are treated as allergen-free because highly refined oils are exempt from allergen labelling in the US (FALCPA) and EU. Cold-pressed nut/seed oils are not covered by this: 'groundnut oil' and 'peanut oil' stay flagged peanuts, 'sesame oil' sesame, 'coconut oil' tree_nuts. Remove 'vegetable oil' and 'oil' if you prefer recipes with them to stay 'unknown'.",
    "'flour' is treated as wheat flour (gluten). 'soy sauce' is flagged soy and gluten. 'coconut' is flagged tree_nuts as a conservative choice.",
    "Composite products (stock, broth, bread, pasta, sausages, bacon, chorizo, wine, mustard, ketchup, chocolate, margarine, Worcestershire sauce) are deliberately left unknown."
  ]
